    {
      "text": "Figure 3.7.2. A conformance-testing view: a System Under Test, with a Document Capture UI, realises the Document Source actor and a Simulator realises the Document Repository; a Test Operator triggers 'Create and submit document', which drives the 'Provide and Register Document Set [ITI-41]' interaction between them.",
